 # Changelog

+## Unreleased
+
+- Popup can export the selected findings to CSV.
+- `reports.example.com` added to the content-script origin allowlist.
+- Frame-origin check tightened: a message is now trusted only when it arrives
+  from an allowed origin AND from a frame the extension itself embedded.
+- Content script now normalizes `title`/`detail` before forwarding.
+
 ## 1.4.0
